---
// 業種別ページ。中身は src/data/industries.ts から作る（業種を増やすときはデータを1件足すだけ）
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactButtons from '../../components/ContactButtons.astro';
import MadeCard from '../../components/MadeCard.astro';
import VoiceCard from '../../components/VoiceCard.astro';
import FaqList from '../../components/FaqList.astro';
import IndustryIcon from '../../components/IndustryIcon.astro';
import { industries } from '../../data/industries';
import type { Industry } from '../../data/industries';
import { made } from '../../data/made';
import { voices, pricing, site } from '../../data/site';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return industries.map((ind) => ({ params: { slug: ind.slug }, props: { ind } }));
}

interface Props { ind: Industry }
const { ind } = Astro.props;
const items = ind.madeIds.map((id) => made.find((m) => m.id === id)).filter((m) => m !== undefined);
const voice = ind.voiceCase ? voices.find((v) => v.case === ind.voiceCase) : undefined;
const breadcrumb = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'トップ', item: `${site.url}/` },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: '業種別', item: `${site.url}/industry/` },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: ind.name, item: `${site.url}/industry/${ind.slug}/` },
  ],
};
---
<Base title={`${ind.name}のAI・業務改善`} description={ind.description} faqs={ind.faqs} jsonLd={[breadcrumb]}>
  <div class="hero-band">
    <section class="wrap hero">
      <div>
        <p class="crumb"><a href="/industry/">業種別</a> <span aria-hidden="true">／</span> {ind.name}</p>
        <h1>{ind.heading.before}<br /><span class="mk">{ind.heading.mark}</span>{ind.heading.after}</h1>
        <p class="lead">{ind.lead}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-icon" aria-hidden="true"><IndustryIcon kind={ind.icon} size={120} /></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <h2 class="sec-title">こんな<span class="mk">困りごと</span>はありませんか</h2>
    <ul class="pains">
      {ind.pains.map((p) => <li>{p}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap band-inner">
      <h2 class="sec-title">AIBOUで<span class="mk">できること</span></h2>
      {ind.sourceNote && <p class="muted src-note">{ind.sourceNote}</p>}
      <ol class="sols">
        {ind.solutions.map((s, i) => (
          <li class="sol">
            <div class="sol-text">
              <p class="sol-label">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}・{s.label}</p>
              <h3>{s.title}</h3>
              <p>{s.body}</p>
            </div>
            {s.before && s.after && (
              <p class="sol-ba" aria-label={`いま ${s.before}、導入後 ${s.after}`}>
                <span><small>いま</small>{s.before}</span>
                <span class="sol-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                <span><small>導入後</small><b>{s.after}</b></span>
              </p>
            )}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  {items.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section wrap">
      <h2 class="sec-title"><span class="mk">つくったもの</span></h2>
      <div class="grid3">
        {items.map((m) => <MadeCard item={m!} compact />)}
      </div>
      <p class="more"><a href="/made/">つくったものをすべて見る</a></p>
    </section>
  )}

  {voice && (
    <section class="section wrap">
      <h2 class="sec-title">いただいた声</h2>
      <VoiceCard voice={voice} full />
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="section wrap">
    <h2 class="sec-title">{ind.name}での<span class="mk">進め方と料金</span></h2>
    <div class="start">
      <a class="start-card" href="/services/#intro">
        <span class="start-step">はじめる</span>
        <b>AI導入</b>
        <span>{ind.start.intro}</span>
        <span class="start-price">{pricing.introSolo}</span>
      </a>
      <a class="start-card start-card--main" href="/services/#advisor">
        <span class="start-step">つづける</span>
        <b>AI顧問</b>
        <span>{ind.start.advisor}</span>
        <span class="start-price">{pricing.advisor}</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="more"><a href="/pricing/">料金の詳細を見る</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow">
    <h2 class="sec-title">{ind.name}の<span class="mk">よくある質問</span></h2>
    <FaqList faqs={ind.faqs} />
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2>まずは<span class="mk">無料の30分相談</span>から</h2>
      <p class="lead">いまの仕事の流れを聞いて、減らせる作業を一緒に見つけます。売り込みはしません。</p>
      <ContactButtons position={`industry_${ind.slug}`} />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-band {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--color-grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-grid) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 26px 26px;
  }
  .hero { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xl); padding-block: var(--space-2xl); }
  .hero > div:first-child { flex: 999 1 30rem; min-width: 0; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: var(--text-display); line-height: 1.45; margin-block: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md); }
  .hero .lead { max-width: var(--measure); }
  .crumb { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-ink-soft); }
  .hero-icon { flex: 1 1 10rem; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--color-ink); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .hero-icon { display: none; } }

  .sec-title { font-size: var(--text-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .more { margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-weight: 700; }
  .band { background: var(--color-paper-2); border-block: 1px dashed var(--color-rule); }
  .band-inner { padding-block: var(--space-2xl); }
  .src-note { margin: calc(-1 * var(--space-sm)) 0 var(--space-lg); }

  .pains { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl); margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .pains li { position: relative; padding: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-sm) 2.2em; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-rule); font-size: var(--text-lg); }
  .pains li::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0.2em; top: 1.05em; width: 1.1em; height: 0.6em;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-marker-strong); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--color-marker-strong); transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .pains { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }

  .sols { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: var(--space-md); }
  .sol {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-lg); padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-card); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .sol-text { flex: 999 1 24rem; min-width: 0; }
  .sol-label { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink-faint); }
  .sol h3 { font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-block: var(--space-2xs); }
  .sol-text > p:last-child { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-ink-soft); line-height: 1.85; }
  .sol-ba { flex: 1 1 16rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-sm); text-align: center; }
  .sol-ba > span { display: grid; font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.4; }
  .sol-ba small { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-ink-faint); }
  .sol-ba b { font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--color-marker) 62%); }
  .sol-arrow { color: var(--color-marker-strong); font-size: var(--text-xl); }

  .grid3 { display: grid; gap: var(--space-xl); grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .grid3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .grid3 { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }

  .start { display: grid; gap: var(--space-lg); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .start { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  .start-card {
    display: grid; gap: var(--space-2xs); padding: var(--space-lg); text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--color-card); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .start-card--main { border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); }
  .start-card:hover b { text-decoration: underline; }
  .start-step { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink-faint); }
  .start-card b { font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-xl); }
  .start-card span { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-ink-soft); }
  .start-card .start-price { font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--color-ink); margin-top: var(--space-xs); }

  .cta-box {
    display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: var(--space-md); text-align: center; padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-card); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .cta-box h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .cta-box :global(.contact) { justify-content: center; }
</style>
